  "caption": "A wolf\u2019s bones turned up in a human cave on a tiny Baltic island where wolves could not have lived.\n\nAncient DNA confirmed it was a true wolf, and isotope work on its remains points to a seafood-heavy diet matching the people who used the site.\n\nThe quiet detail is logistical: somewhere in the Stone Age, someone ferried a live predator across open water and kept it alive on fish and seals.\n\nThe story unfolds slide by slide.\n\n#TheBoldUnknown #TheUnknownExplained #Curiosity #HiddenHistory #Archaeology #Zooarchaeology #AncientDNA #IsotopeAnalysis #BronzeAge #StoneAge",
